WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Formula: His brain is so useful. It’s perfect to dig it out and replace it with the boss.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:05,320
I will never forget it after changing it, and it will be announced to all mankind at that time.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,760
Sacrifice one of his grandfathers and ask him to come over quickly to replace it.

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,560
Never betray all mankind

5
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:14,890
In the apocalypse, you can still drink a cup of iced fruit tea while worrying about disasters

6
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:20,150
It's only him now

7
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:22,110
Xia Baobao, try this

8
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:26,330
My aunt also baked pineapple buns, peach pie and beef patties.

9
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:30,100
Auntie, don't be too busy. Sit down for a while. It's enough to eat.

10
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:35,850
Captain Han, I have something important to tell you.

11
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,850
What's important

12
